res monsters in almost every map as well, they all will jumpscare you if you get too close, so be careful!\n\nThe creator, owner, and developer of this game is Hyper. If you see him, say hi!\n\nHave fun in Hyper's Gorilla Horror, and even more importantly, DON'T GET CAUGHT..", "short_description": "Theres something out there.. Don't Get Caught."}]}, "developer_name": "Hyper", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rVaCvb6ct6CIy1-_SRd99pjqx-h67LNUooY1UxIhJ7g/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hyper Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O_Lr4jORd5JYUIVmm_hRAy4pFtqUkoo_83S94ynkjNc/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "30201342252815041"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820983_686623534221442_171524266749271366_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sk0bxGxD7hkQ7kNvwFFoDMO&_nc_oc=AdpE1L6abz66Uob2uZVwy6IebuboM5xV6YVt1Y4WxoZ7idGuoDwoLP9LKPA6Tv7u82c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTZ5F6HZGjKQSVFFDpkG-Aul_PrAKVV_iX-WP-ngdn4xg&oe=6B0325E2"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_tria